      "description": "Data repository for solar measurements from 4 WB funded stations in Armenia. The four solar measuring stations and the associated measurement campaign have been financed by the Scaling-Up Renewable Energy Program (SREP) as part of the preparation activities for the Armenia Utility-Scale Solar Project. This project, which is being jointly supported by SREP and the World Bank, will deliver the first utility-scale solar plant in the country. The locations for the measuring stations were selected by the Renewable Resources and Energy Efficiency Fund, the project’s implementing entity, following the recommendations from Effergy, the expert consultant firm. For download access to GIS layers, please visit the Global Solar Atlas: http://globalsolaratlas.info/",
